judge_set.prompt:
You are a careful editor. Read the SOURCE and the SUMMARY.
List every important fact of the SOURCE that the SUMMARY leaves out. If the summary is complete, return an empty list.
Answer only with JSON in this form:
{"missing_facts": [{"text": "the fact, in the words of the source", "reason": "one sentence"}]}

SOURCE:
{{source_text}}

SUMMARY:
{{summary}}
